{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>美國聯合航空控股公司表示，已解決影響其離港航班的大規模系統故障。這是近期美國航空業遭遇的最新一起技術故障事件。美聯航在一份聲明中表示：「雖然部分航班出現延誤，但正在飛行中的航班以及美聯航快運（United Express）航班均未受到影響。」</p>\n<h2>最新資訊</h2>\n<h2>編輯精選</h2>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>熱門評論</h3>\n<h3>相關文章</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>Top 10</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.871835+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:10:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:25:40.150347+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:43:01.374562+00:00","content_hash":"3ddb38074dbfc23aa815c10b8fbf5ef2da0a56127bee40507ed397fcc5526d80","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.871835+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}